# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PKCE Manual Authentication (Microsoft Token Sign-In)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# When Microsoft tokens are missing or expired, OnStarJS will initiate a PKCE
# (Proof Key for Code Exchange) authentication flow and display a sign-in URL.
#
# Complete authentication by visiting that URL in your browser, then capture
# the callback code and set ONSTARJS_PKCE_AUTH_CODE below.
#
# You can provide either:
#   1. The full callback URL (preferred):
#      ONSTARJS_PKCE_AUTH_CODE="msauth.com.gm.myChevrolet://auth?code=M.R3_...&state=..."
#
#   2. Just the raw authorization code:
#      ONSTARJS_PKCE_AUTH_CODE="M.R3_..."
#
# After setting this value, run your app again. OnStarJS will exchange the code
# for Microsoft tokens, then automatically clear this env var from .env.
# ONSTARJS_PKCE_AUTH_CODE=""